---
const arrow = '<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>'
---
<section class="section section--light" id="produtos">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Produtos</span>
      <h2>A Calculadora de IR mais completa do Brasil.</h2>
      <p>Cálculo, DARF e Declaração de Imposto de Renda — para investimentos no Brasil e no Exterior.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="pf-grid">
      <div class="pf-col">
        <div class="pf-head">
          <div class="pf-eyebrow">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/><line x1="3" y1="20" x2="21" y2="20"/></svg>
            Bolsa de Valores · B3
          </div>
          <p class="pf-lead"><b>IR B3.</b> Apuração mensal de IR para ações, FIIs, ETFs, opções e day trade — feita em apenas 3 passos.</p>
          <a href="#" class="pf-cta" id="product-b3-btn">Conhecer o produto <Fragment set:html={arrow} /></a>
        </div>
        <div class="pf-tiles">
          <div class="pf-tile"><span class="pf-tile-ico"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="17 8 12 3 7 8"/><line x1="12" y1="3" x2="12" y2="15"/></svg></span><span class="pf-tile-lbl">Notas SINACOR</span></div>
          <div class="pf-tile"><span class="pf-tile-ico"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><polyline points="9 12 11.5 14.5 16 9.5"/></svg></span><span class="pf-tile-lbl">Conferência B3</span></div>
          <div class="pf-tile"><span class="pf-tile-ico"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 21V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v17l-3-2-2 2-2-2-2 2-2-2-3 2z"/><line x1="9" y1="8" x2="15" y2="8"/><line x1="9" y1="12" x2="15" y2="12"/></svg></span><span class="pf-tile-lbl">Geração de DARF</span></div>
          <div class="pf-tile"><span class="pf-tile-ico"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="9" y1="13" x2="15" y2="13"/><line x1="9" y1="17" x2="15" y2="17"/></svg></span><span class="pf-tile-lbl">Declaração anual</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pf-col">
        <div class="pf-head">
          <div class="pf-eyebrow">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
            Investimentos no Exterior
          </div>
          <p class="pf-lead"><b>IR Exterior.</b> Imposto sobre investimentos fora do Brasil, calculado com precisão e total segurança.</p>
          <a href="#" class="pf-cta" id="product-exterior-btn">Conhecer o produto <Fragment set:html={arrow} /></a>
        </div>
        <div class="pf-tiles">
          <div class="pf-tile"><span class="pf-tile-ico"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2"/><line x1="8" y1="6" x2="16" y2="6"/><circle cx="8" cy="11" r="0.6" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="12" cy="11" r="0.6" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="16" cy="11" r="0.6" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="8" cy="15" r="0.6" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="12" cy="15" r="0.6" fill="currentColor"/><line x1="16" y1="14" x2="16" y2="18"/></svg></span><span class="pf-tile-lbl">Câmbio PTAX</span></div>
          <div class="pf-tile"><span class="pf-tile-ico"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="9" y1="13" x2="15" y2="13"/><line x1="9" y1="17" x2="15" y2="17"/></svg></span><span class="pf-tile-lbl">Lei 14.754/23</span></div>
          <div class="pf-tile"><span class="pf-tile-ico"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 0l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.07 0l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/></svg></span><span class="pf-tile-lbl">Avenue · Nomad · IBKR</span></div>
          <div class="pf-tile"><span class="pf-tile-ico"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg></span><span class="pf-tile-lbl">Relatórios</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script is:inline>
  document.getElementById('product-b3-btn')?.addEventListener('click', function () {
    window.posthog?.capture('product_learn_more_clicked', { product_name: 'IR B3' });
  });
  document.getElementById('product-exterior-btn')?.addEventListener('click', function () {
    window.posthog?.capture('product_learn_more_clicked', { product_name: 'IR Exterior' });
  });
</script>
